### 11. What is the purpose of Spring Boot Actuator?

**Answer:**
Actuator provides production-ready features like health checks, metrics, and monitoring. You can expose endpoints like `/actuator/health`, `/actuator/metrics`, `/actuator/info`, and integrate with Prometheus or Grafana.

